```

The Spring dependency chain:
```
ProxyApplicationService
  -> CategoryService (unchanged)
    -> CategoryRepository (interface)
      -> CachedCategoryRepository (@Primary, @Component)
        -> CategoryRepositoryImpl (@Component("proxyCategoryRepository"), via @Qualifier)
          -> ProxyApiClient -> GraphQL API
```

### 10.2 Coroutine Compatibility

The existing `runBlocking(Dispatchers.IO) { async { ... } }` pattern works unchanged because:
- `CachedCategoryRepository.findAllByIds()` is a regular (non-suspend) function
- Caffeine L1 lookups are in-memory (microseconds)
