```

`ProxyApplicationService` continues to call `categoryService.getCategories(ids)`, which calls `categoryRepository.findAllByIds(ids)`. Spring injects `CachedCategoryRepository` because of `@Primary`. The cached version partitions the IDs, serves hits from L1/L2, and only calls the delegate (original `CategoryRepositoryImpl`) for true misses.

